      <description>&lt;p&gt;&amp;ldquo;Code is poetry written for machines. But even poetry needs a rough draft.&amp;rdquo;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Every line is a verse. Every function, a stanza. The best code tells a story.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&amp;ldquo;Write code that sings, even to the machine.&amp;rdquo;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/blockquote&gt;</description>
